    "background_story": "Georgina was a Londoner through and through, born and raised in the vibrant East End. She grew up surrounded by the sights and sounds of the bustling streets, where the clip-clop of horse hooves on cobblestone was a familiar rhythm. As a young woman, Georgina became fascinated with the history of the Hackney carriage, the iconic horse-drawn vehicle that had once dominated the city's streets. She spent years researching and restoring a beautiful old Hackney carriage, which she eventually used to offer guided tours of the city. Georgina's passion for the Hackney carriage and its rich history made her a beloved fixture in the community, and her tours became a must-do experience for visitors to London.",
